                Explore the <NavLink href="channels/efcore/">EF Core tutorial and learning path</NavLink> for the full Entity Framework Core series. What to read next: if you haven't already, start the series with <NavLink href="blogs/add-cross-cutting-concerns-to-ef-core-without-touching-your-repositories/">EF Core interceptors for DbContext auditing and diagnostics</NavLink>, or lock down your schema with <NavLink href="blogs/enforce-database-schema-standards-automatically-with-ef-core-conventions/">EF Core conventions for Code First migrations and foreign keys</NavLink>.
            </p>
        </Summary>
    </ContentBody>
</Content>
